          "name": "smart_query",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:ca0ef9dace17ab94aaa59fbd8a72c36009eabb343e3b75a37e824c6cd08503d2",
          "description": "BIRD SQL-based intelligent query tool. Analyzes natural-language questions to (1) extract relevant schema, (2) match similar few-shot examples, (3) assess complexity, (4) request clarification for ambiguous questions. Call this tool before run_query. For a new data source, first inspect the schema with list_tables, then register keyword-to-table mappings via manage_keyword_map to significantly improve accuracy. Note: when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set, table-name lists (never query results or row data) may be sent to the Anthropic API as a fallback for table selection.",
